---
description: "Import conventions for Nest modules and Lambda package."
globs:
  - "src/**/*.ts"
  - "lambda/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Imports

## Nest (`src/`)

- Prefer path alias `src/...` consistent with existing files
- Keep Nest module imports explicit; avoid circular module graphs
- Do not import TypeORM entities into shared type barrels
- Feature modules import shared services from the exporting module

## Lambda (`lambda/src/`)

- Relative imports within `lambda/src` only
- Never import from repository-root `src/`

## General

- Prefer named exports
- Group/order imports to match ESLint/Prettier output
- Do not add unused imports
